  "name": "JODC Marine Organisms Database",
  "description": "Parameter Plankton distribution and abundance Measurement Details \"This file contains marine organisms data, mainly plankton, observed by Environment Agency, Fisheries Agency and Meteorological Agency in JODC own format. This data management system composes of 3 subsystems, namely Marine Organisms Code Management, Marine Organisms Data Management, Marine Organisms Data Processing. [ A TCODE project ]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Archive and service as National Oceanographic Data Center in Japan.",
